### UserScripts project ###

# Build output of vite-plugin-monkey lives in packages/*/dist (already ignored
# by the `dist` rule above) — local builds stay out of git. The release
# workflow force-adds only dist/*.user.js and dist/*.meta.js to main so
# @updateURL / @downloadURL (raw.githubusercontent.com) resolve.

# bun lockfile IS tracked (bun.lock) — only ignore its caches if any appear.
.bun/

# Vite cache (usually under node_modules/.vite, covered above)
.vite/

# Userscript manager local installs (drag-and-drop during dev)
*.local.user.js

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Editors
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/settings.json
